             NCombatCardPile._pile reached only as "_pile" in a derived class, or
             combatState.History.Add(...) resolving to the internal CombatHistory.Add - neither
             literally spells the owning type's name at the call site, so grepping for the type name
             doesn't find them). Copied verbatim from Downfall.csproj's own list instead (same
             rationale Collector.csproj's header comment gives: most of it is for other characters'
             code and isn't needed here, but trimming it is a follow-up cleanup, not required for
             this extraction). -->
